            "Select...": [
                "Vybra\u0165..."
            ],
            "<strong>Simple Social Buttons<\/strong> by <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/wpbrigade.com\/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade<\/a><\/strong> adds an advanced set of social media sharing buttons to your WordPress sites, such as: <strong>Facebook<\/strong>, <strong>Twitter\/X<\/strong>, <strong>LinkedIn<\/strong>, <strong>WhatsApp<\/strong>, <strong>Viber<\/strong>, <strong>Reddit<\/strong> and <strong>Pinterest<\/strong>. This makes it the most flexible social sharing plugin for everyone.": [
                "<strong>Simple Social Buttons<\/strong> od <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/wpbrigade.com\/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade<\/a><\/strong> prid\u00e1va pokro\u010dil\u00fa sadu tla\u010didiel na zdie\u013eanie na soci\u00e1lnych m\u00e9di\u00e1ch na va\u0161e str\u00e1nky WordPress, ako s\u00fa: <strong>Facebook<\/strong>, <strong>Twitter\/X<\/strong>, <strong>LinkedIn<\/strong>, <strong>WhatsApp<\/strong>, <strong>Viber<\/strong>, <strong>Reddit<\/strong> a <strong>Pinterest<\/strong>. To z neho rob\u00ed najflexibilnej\u0161\u00ed plugin na zdie\u013eanie na soci\u00e1lnych m\u00e9di\u00e1ch pre v\u0161etk\u00fdch."
            ],
            "Control how share buttons appear on images and media within your posts.": [
                "Ovl\u00e1dajte, ako sa tla\u010didl\u00e1 zdie\u013eania zobrazuj\u00fa na obr\u00e1zkoch a m\u00e9di\u00e1ch vo va\u0161ich pr\u00edspevkoch."
            ],
            "Configure your share popup: set the message, timing, and trigger behavior.": [
                "Konfigurujte svoje vyskakovacie okno na zdie\u013eanie: nastavte spr\u00e1vu, \u010dasovanie a spr\u00e1vanie sp\u00fa\u0161\u0165ania."
            ],
            "Set up a slide-in share prompt with custom messaging, position, and timing": [
                "Nastavte posuvn\u00e9 v\u00fdzvy na zdie\u013eanie s vlastn\u00fdmi spr\u00e1vami, poz\u00edciou a \u010dasovan\u00edm"
            ],
            "HTTP\/HTTPS Counts Resolve": [
                "HTTP\/HTTPS po\u010dty rie\u0161en\u00ed"
            ],
            "hour": [
                "hodina"
            ],
            "hours": [
                "hodiny"
            ],
            "Internal share click counts are recorded for supported networks (for example Twitter\/X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp) when visitors use the sharing buttons on your site. Counts are stored locally and are not sent to those social networks. Clear your page cache after upgrading the plugin so button markup stays in sync.": [
                "Intern\u00e9 po\u010dty kliknut\u00ed na zdie\u013eanie s\u00fa zaznamen\u00e1van\u00e9 pre podporovan\u00e9 siete (napr\u00edklad Twitter\/X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp), ke\u010f n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edci pou\u017e\u00edvaj\u00fa tla\u010didl\u00e1 zdie\u013eania na va\u0161ej str\u00e1nke. Po\u010dty s\u00fa ulo\u017een\u00e9 lok\u00e1lne a nie s\u00fa odosielan\u00e9 do t\u00fdchto soci\u00e1lnych siet\u00ed. Vyma\u017ete vyrovn\u00e1vaciu pam\u00e4\u0165 svojej str\u00e1nky po aktualiz\u00e1cii pluginu, aby sa zna\u010dka tla\u010didla udr\u017eala v synchroniz\u00e1cii."
            ],
            "Enable to remove all settings upon uninstalling the plugin.": [
                "Povo\u013ete odstr\u00e1nenie v\u0161etk\u00fdch nastaven\u00ed pri odin\u0161talovan\u00ed pluginu."
            ],
            "Enable to reset all settings back to default upon saving.": [
                "Povo\u013ete resetovanie v\u0161etk\u00fdch nastaven\u00ed na predvolen\u00e9 hodnoty pri ulo\u017een\u00edm."
            ],
            "Click To Post": [
                "Kliknite na zverejnenie"
            ],
            "Unlock Click to Tweet Feature with Pro!": [
                "Odomknite funkciu Klikn\u00fa\u0165 na Tweet s Pro!"
            ],
            "Get the powerful Click to Tweet functionality that lets you create engaging, tweetable content directly in your posts. This Pro feature helps increase social engagement and drive more traffic to your site.": [
                "Z\u00edskajte mocn\u00fa funkciu Klikn\u00fa\u0165 na Tweet, ktor\u00e1 v\u00e1m umo\u017en\u00ed vytv\u00e1ra\u0165 p\u00fatav\u00fd, tweetovate\u013en\u00fd obsah priamo vo va\u0161ich pr\u00edspevkoch. T\u00e1to funkcia Pro pom\u00e1ha zvy\u0161ova\u0165 soci\u00e1lnu anga\u017eovanos\u0165 a priv\u00e1dza\u0165 viac n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edkov na va\u0161u str\u00e1nku."
            ],
            "Click here to Upgrade": [
                "Kliknite sem na aktualiz\u00e1ciu"
            ],
            "Loading Pro settings...": [
                "Na\u010d\u00edtavanie nastaven\u00ed Pro..."
            ],
            "Loading Pro component...": [
                "Na\u010d\u00edtavanie Pro komponentu..."
            ],
            "Configure how your inline share buttons appear within your content.": [
                "Konfigurujte, ako sa va\u0161e inline tla\u010didl\u00e1 zdie\u013eania zobrazuj\u00fa vo va\u0161om obsahu."
            ],
            "For Facebook share count you need to add Facebook App ID and Secret in the Social tab.": [
                "Pre po\u010det zdie\u013ean\u00ed na Facebooku mus\u00edte prida\u0165 Facebook App ID a Secret na karte Soci\u00e1lne."
            ],
            "Show only a set number of icons in your content. Remaining icons open in a popup when visitors tap the + button.": [
                "Zobrazi\u0165 len stanoven\u00fd po\u010det ikon vo va\u0161om obsahu. Zvy\u0161n\u00e9 ikony sa otvoria vo vyskakovacom okne, ke\u010f n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edci stla\u010dia tla\u010didlo +."
            ],
            "This text appears on your site as a heading above the inline share buttons. It is not used as the title when someone shares your content on social networks.": [
                "Tento text sa na va\u0161ej str\u00e1nke zobrazuje ako nadpis nad inline tla\u010didlami na zdie\u013eanie. Nepou\u017e\u00edva sa ako n\u00e1zov, ke\u010f niekto zdie\u013ea v\u00e1\u0161 obsah na soci\u00e1lnych sie\u0165ach."
            ],
            "Press Enter to move to Inactive.": [
                "Stla\u010dte Enter, aby ste pre\u0161li do neakt\u00edvneho stavu."
            ],
            "Press Enter to move to Active.": [
                "Stla\u010dte Enter, aby ste pre\u0161li do akt\u00edvneho stavu."
            ],
            "Use Up and Down arrow keys to reorder.": [
