            "Simple Social Buttons on NextGEN Gallery": [
                "Jednoduch\u00e9 soci\u00e1lne tla\u010didl\u00e1 na NextGEN Gallery"
            ],
            "Select the display styles to position your share buttons.": [
                "Vyberte \u0161t\u00fdly zobrazenia na umiestnenie va\u0161ich tla\u010didiel na zdie\u013eanie."
            ],
            "Configure the appearance and behavior of your sidebar share buttons.": [
                "Konfigurujte vzh\u013ead a spr\u00e1vanie va\u0161ich tla\u010didiel na zdie\u013eanie v bo\u010dnom paneli."
            ],
            "Show only a set number of icons in the sidebar. Remaining icons open in a popup when visitors tap the + button.": [
                "Zobrazi\u0165 iba stanoven\u00fd po\u010det ikon v bo\u010dnom paneli. Zvy\u0161n\u00e9 ikony sa otvor\u00ed v okne, ke\u010f n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edci klikn\u00fa na tla\u010didlo +."
            ],
            "Add your X username to append via= to Twitter\/X share links from your buttons.": [
                "Pridajte svoje X pou\u017e\u00edvate\u013esk\u00e9 meno na pripojenie via= k Twitter\/X odkazom na zdie\u013eanie z va\u0161ich tla\u010didiel."
            ],
            "Twitter\/X @username": [
                "Twitter\/X @pou\u017e\u00edvate\u013esk\u00e9_meno"
            ],
            "Facebook App": [
                "Facebook aplik\u00e1cia"
            ],
            "How to create a Facebook app": [
                "Ako vytvori\u0165 Facebook aplik\u00e1ciu"
            ],
            "Facebook App ID": [
                "Facebook App ID"
            ],
            "Required for Facebook share counts. Add your App ID and Secret from the Facebook developer portal.": [
                "Vy\u017eaduje sa pre po\u010dty zdie\u013ean\u00ed na Facebooku. Pridajte svoje ID aplik\u00e1cie a tajn\u00fd k\u013e\u00fa\u010d z port\u00e1lu pre v\u00fdvoj\u00e1rov Facebooku."
            ],
            "Facebook App Secret": [
                "Tajn\u00fd k\u013e\u00fa\u010d aplik\u00e1cie Facebook"
            ],
            "Snapchat uses Snap Creative Kit Web so mobile visitors open the Snapchat app with your page link ready to share.": [
                "Snapchat pou\u017e\u00edva Snap Creative Kit Web, tak\u017ee mobiln\u00ed n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edci otvoria aplik\u00e1ciu Snapchat s odkazom na va\u0161u str\u00e1nku pripraven\u00fdm na zdie\u013eanie."
            ],
            "Snap Kit Client ID (optional)": [
                "ID klienta Snap Kit (volite\u013en\u00e9)"
            ],
            "Optional. Add your Snap Kit Client ID to attribute shares in the Snap Kit developer portal. Sharing works without it.": [
                "Volite\u013en\u00e9. Pridajte svoje ID klienta Snap Kit na priradenie zdie\u013ean\u00ed v port\u00e1li pre v\u00fdvoj\u00e1rov Snap Kit. Zdie\u013eanie funguje aj bez toho."
            ],
            "How it works": [
                "Ako to funguje"
            ],
            "Add Snapchat from the Settings tab like any other button.": [
                "Pridajte Snapchat z karty Nastavenia ako ak\u00e9ko\u013evek in\u00e9 tla\u010didlo."
            ],
            "On mobile, tapping the button opens the Snapchat app share flow for the current page.": [
                "Na mobile \u0165uknutie na tla\u010didlo otvor\u00ed zdie\u013eac\u00ed tok aplik\u00e1cie Snapchat pre aktu\u00e1lnu str\u00e1nku."
            ],
            "On desktop, a Snapcode window opens so users can scan and share from their phone.": [
                "Na desktopovom po\u010d\u00edta\u010di sa otvor\u00ed okno Snapcode, aby si pou\u017e\u00edvatelia mohli naskenova\u0165 a zdie\u013ea\u0165 z ich telef\u00f3nu."
            ],
            "Keep Open Graph tags enabled so Snapchat can show your page title and preview.": [
                "Majte povolen\u00e9 zna\u010dky Open Graph, aby Snapchat mohol zobrazi\u0165 n\u00e1zov a n\u00e1h\u013ead va\u0161ej str\u00e1nky."
            ],
            "Official Buttons": [
                "Ofici\u00e1lne tla\u010didl\u00e1"
            ],
            "Choose a button style that fits your site's look and feel.": [
                "Vyberte \u0161t\u00fdl tla\u010didla, ktor\u00fd sa hod\u00ed k vzh\u013eadu a pocitu v\u00e1\u0161ho webu."
            ],
            "Dismiss this notice.": [
                "Zavrie\u0165 toto ozn\u00e1menie."
            ],
            "Dismiss": [
                "Zavrie\u0165"
            ],
            "Share on LinkedIn": [
                "Zdie\u013ea\u0165 na LinkedIn"
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you set custom background, hover, and icon colors for every button, so they blend naturally with your website's design instead of standing out like a default plugin. Buttons that fit your site tend to get clicked more, which means more shares and more traffic for you. Pro also adds features like buttons on images, popups on exit intent, fly in slide animations, and more.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro v\u00e1m umo\u017e\u0148uje nastavi\u0165 vlastn\u00e9 farby pozadia, hover a ik\u00f3n pre ka\u017ed\u00e9 tla\u010didlo, tak\u017ee sa prirodzene zl\u00fa\u010dia s dizajnom va\u0161ej webovej str\u00e1nky namiesto toho, aby vy\u010dnievali ako predvolen\u00fd plugin. Tla\u010didl\u00e1, ktor\u00e9 sa hodia k va\u0161ej str\u00e1nke, maj\u00fa tendenciu by\u0165 \u010dastej\u0161ie kliknut\u00e9, \u010do znamen\u00e1 viac zdie\u013ean\u00ed a viac n\u00e1v\u0161tevnosti pre v\u00e1s. Pro tie\u017e prid\u00e1va funkcie ako tla\u010didl\u00e1 na obr\u00e1zkoch, vyskakovacie okn\u00e1 pri \u00famysle opustenia, anim\u00e1cie vklzovania a \u010fal\u0161ie."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you display share buttons directly on images and photos across your posts and pages, choose their position, add icon spacing, and set custom colors that match your site. You can also hide them on mobile and control exactly which post types they appear on. It's an easy way to turn every image into a shareable opportunity and drive more traffic.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro v\u00e1m umo\u017e\u0148uje zobrazi\u0165 tla\u010didl\u00e1 na zdie\u013eanie priamo na obr\u00e1zkoch a fotografi\u00e1ch vo va\u0161ich pr\u00edspevkoch a str\u00e1nkach, vybra\u0165 ich polohu, prida\u0165 medzery medzi ikony a nastavi\u0165 vlastn\u00e9 farby, ktor\u00e9 zodpovedaj\u00fa va\u0161ej str\u00e1nke. M\u00f4\u017eete ich tie\u017e skry\u0165 na mobile a presne ovl\u00e1da\u0165, na ktor\u00fdch typoch pr\u00edspevkov sa zobrazuj\u00fa. Je to jednoduch\u00fd sp\u00f4sob, ako premeni\u0165 ka\u017ed\u00fd obr\u00e1zok na zdie\u013eate\u013en\u00fa pr\u00edle\u017eitos\u0165 a zv\u00fd\u0161i\u0165 n\u00e1v\u0161tevnos\u0165."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you create a custom share popup with your own title and message, and trigger it exactly when it matters, like before visitors leave or after they scroll. You can add animation, display share counts or total shares to build social proof, and set custom colors to match your brand. It's a smart way to catch visitor attention right when they're most likely to share.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro v\u00e1m umo\u017e\u0148uje vytvori\u0165 vlastn\u00e9 vyskakovacie okno na zdie\u013eanie s vlastn\u00fdm n\u00e1zvom a spr\u00e1vou a aktivova\u0165 ho presne vtedy, ke\u010f je to d\u00f4le\u017eit\u00e9, napr\u00edklad predt\u00fdm, ako n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edci od\u00eddu, alebo po tom, \u010do posun\u00fa. M\u00f4\u017eete prida\u0165 anim\u00e1ciu, zobrazi\u0165 po\u010dty zdie\u013ean\u00ed alebo celkov\u00e9 zdie\u013eania na budovanie soci\u00e1lneho d\u00f4kazu a nastavi\u0165 vlastn\u00e9 farby, ktor\u00e9 zodpovedaj\u00fa va\u0161ej zna\u010dke. Je to inteligentn\u00fd sp\u00f4sob, ako up\u00fata\u0165 pozornos\u0165 n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edkov presne vtedy, ke\u010f s\u00fa najpravdepodobnej\u0161ie, \u017ee zdie\u013eaj\u00fa."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you create a custom Fly In box with your own title and message, choose its position and animation, and even display share counts or total shares to build social proof. You can fine-tune timing, icon spacing, and colors to match your brand, and control which post types it appears on. It's a great way to prompt visitors to share right when they're most engaged.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro v\u00e1m umo\u017e\u0148uje vytvori\u0165 vlastn\u00e9 vyskakovacie okno Fly In s vlastn\u00fdm n\u00e1zvom a spr\u00e1vou, vybra\u0165 jeho polohu a anim\u00e1ciu a dokonca zobrazi\u0165 po\u010dty zdie\u013ean\u00ed alebo celkov\u00e9 zdie\u013eania na budovanie soci\u00e1lneho d\u00f4kazu. M\u00f4\u017eete jemne doladi\u0165 \u010dasovanie, medzery medzi ikonami a farby, aby zodpovedali va\u0161ej zna\u010dke, a ovl\u00e1da\u0165, na ktor\u00fdch typoch pr\u00edspevkov sa zobrazuje. Je to skvel\u00fd sp\u00f4sob, ako vyzva\u0165 n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edkov, aby zdie\u013eali pr\u00e1ve vtedy, ke\u010f s\u00fa najviac zapojen\u00ed."
            ],
